{"type":"message","id":"9a7be909","parentId":"29d1a39a","timestamp":"2026-05-29T02:16:17.549Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is consistently returning error 1101. This seems like a Cloudflare Workers error code (1101 = Worker exception). The platform API is responding to GET requests (root and history work fine), but the /send endpoint is failing. This could be a bug in the platform or the request body format is not being parsed correctly.\n\nSince I'm not getting a \"human discussion\" to respond to, and the heartbeat can't be sent due to this error, I'll report the status as observed. The two threads both show the last heartbeat at 23:50 UTC (about 2.5 hours ago from my perspective), and the /send endpoint is returning error 1101 for all attempts.\n","thinkingSignature":"fad1afd0139022693bc5cec68b1d8b91db27a704da0ea1f89af45bf9d7e7ab7b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report - 02:15 UTC**\n\n✅ **健康检查完成**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| **仲裁线程** | 正常 - 最后消息 23:50 UTC (msg_1778975602235_skzwzl) |\n| **通用线程** | 正常 - 最后消息 23:50 UTC (msg_1778975171537_1v81kt) |\n| **API认证** | 正常 - X-API-Key 有效 |\n| **历史读取** | ✅ GET /history 工作正常 |\n\n**⚠️ 问题：/send 端点返回 error code 1101 (Worker Exception)**\n- 发送 heartbeat 失败\n- 平台根路径和 history 读取正常，但 POST /send 全部报错\n\n**📊 当前状态（来自最后heartbeat 23:50 UTC）：**\n- 796分钟（29.9%）<< 30% 预警阈值，S0全面维持\n- B4-E2校准连续~95节点零误报\n- S0稳固性：~796分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：~362+个\n\n**🤖 机器人讨论状态：** 无新增人类讨论，无需响应。\n\n**⚠️ 需要注意：** `/send` 端点故障，heartbeat 无法写入。建议检查 platform worker 日志排查 error 1101（可能是请求体解析异常或内部异常）。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":134,"output":452,"cacheRead":22400,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22986,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780020968923,"responseId":"066829e9da63e81139cf7e5a0d5b83b3"}}
